{"id":"44cd21d3d12e4d8d","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-interpretability.md","title":"Relative Interpretability","display":"df-interpretability — Relative Interpretability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-interpretability","aliases":["67-df-interpretability"],"display":"df-interpretability — Relative Interpretability","depends_on":["[[67-df-sentence]]","[[67-df-relative-interpretation]]","[[67-df-prim-provability]]","[[67-df-prim-theory]]"],"source_scope":"第 6 章 §1，印刷页 75–76；PDF 第 86–87 页","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"不适用（定义）","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-interpretability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-interpretability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-interpretability — Relative Interpretability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"95924098a9c5f575\" href=\"?note=95924098a9c5f575\" title=\"67-df-relative-interpretation\">67-df-relative-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d91538d9e6829fd1\" href=\"?note=d91538d9e6829fd1\" title=\"67-df-prim-theory\">67-df-prim-theory</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"第 6 章 §1，印刷页 75–76；PDF 第 86–87 页"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"不适用（定义）"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是算术公理集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(S\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\psi\">\\(T\\vdash\\psi\\)</span> 是元语言可推导性（<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a>）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelInt}(T,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{RelInt}(T,\\tau)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"95924098a9c5f575\" href=\"?note=95924098a9c5f575\" title=\"67-df-relative-interpretation\">67-df-relative-interpretation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 遍历算术公式函数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Int}(S,T,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Int}(S,T,\\tau)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\unlhd T\">\\(S\\unlhd T\\)</span> 在下式定义；方向固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 解释 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Int}(S,T,\\tau)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathrm{RelInt}(T,\\tau)\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n(S\\vdash\\varphi\\Longrightarrow T\\vdash\\tau(\\varphi)),\\\\\nS\\unlhd T&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\tau\\ \\mathrm{Int}(S,T,\\tau).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Int}(S,T,\\tau)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathrm{RelInt}(T,\\tau)\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n(S\\vdash\\varphi\\Longrightarrow T\\vdash\\tau(\\varphi)),\\\\\nS\\unlhd T&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\tau\\ \\mathrm{Int}(S,T,\\tau).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\le T\">\\(S\\le T\\)</span>；此处继续沿用本册原接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\unlhd T\">\\(S\\unlhd T\\)</span>，避免与严格解释度次序混淆。翻译既需满足相对化语法，也需在目标理论中定义非空域和函数图。</p>\n<p>来源定义陈述已核对。这是元语言关系，不是把存在某个解释的断言自动视为 PA 内可证；原书第 76 页特别指出无限源理论时这一区别不可省略。</p>\n<p>来源：Per Lindström, <em>Aspects of Incompleteness</em>，本次用户提供 PDF；第 6 章 §1，印刷页 75–76；PDF 第 86–87 页。</p>\n<p>证明核验范围：不适用（定义）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-relative-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"95924098a9c5f575","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-relative-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-prim-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-theory","status":"resolved","id":"d91538d9e6829fd1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-prim-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 是算术公理集；$S\\vdash\\varphi$、$T\\vdash\\psi$ 是元语言可推导性（[[67-df-prim-provability]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-relative-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"95924098a9c5f575","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RelInt}(T,\\tau)$ 取 [[67-df-relative-interpretation]]；$\\tau$ 遍历算术公式函数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"S\\vdash\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RelInt}(T,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Int}(S,T,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"S\\unlhd T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Int}(S,T,\\tau)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathrm{RelInt}(T,\\tau)\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n(S\\vdash\\varphi\\Longrightarrow T\\vdash\\tau(\\varphi)),\\\\\nS\\unlhd T&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\tau\\ \\mathrm{Int}(S,T,\\tau).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"S\\le T","display":false},{"tex":"S\\unlhd T","display":false}],"bytes":1849,"backlinks":[{"id":"916ea8724331b0a4","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$g[S]$ 是源公理代码集；$\\sigma$ 遍历至多自由变量 $z$ 的算术公式。$\\mathrm{Num}_T,\\mathrm{Binum}_T$ 取 [[67-df-numeration]]，$\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma$ 取 [[67-df-formula-provability]]，$\\unlhd$ 取 [[67-df-interpretability]]。"},{"id":"d3bce54f4db028d4","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\unlhd$ 取 [[67-df-interpretability]]；扩张 $A\\cup\\{\\sigma\\}$、$B\\cup\\{\\sigma\\}$ 不额外假设一致。"},{"id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\unlhd$ 见 [[67-df-interpretability]]，$\\equiv_{\\mathrm{int}}$ 见 [[67-df-interpretability-degree]]；不要求扩张 $A$ 一致。"},{"id":"31b7e1fe9d49615e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 是算术公理集；$\\mathrm{Int}(S,T,\\tau)$ 取 [[67-df-interpretability]]。"},{"i